00:02:10.679 --> 00:02:11.900
Yeah, obviously not.

00:02:11.900 --> 00:02:16.930
And it's important to understand this currency
manipulation allegation, which is not untrue.

00:02:16.930 --> 00:02:17.930
By the way.

00:02:17.930 --> 00:02:24.630
China does manipulate the value of their currency
for trade benefit purposes by reducing the

00:02:24.630 --> 00:02:26.579
value of their currency.

00:02:26.579 --> 00:02:32.879
It makes it cheaper for other countries to
buy stuff from China to import to their countries.

00:02:32.879 --> 00:02:39.470
If you get more yuan per dollar, you can now
get more Chinese stuff per dollar effectively

00:02:39.470 --> 00:02:41.000
making it cheaper.

00:02:41.000 --> 00:02:42.180
That's true.

00:02:42.180 --> 00:02:46.280
And it's not going to change the way that
Donald Trump has been handling Chinese trade

00:02:46.280 --> 00:02:47.280
